<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nextel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nextel started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group Inc said Timothy O'Neill initiated coverage of Nextel Communications Inc with short and long-term buys.</p>
<p>-- said expects Nextel to post a loss of $4.60 a share in fiscal 1997 and a loss of $4.50 a share in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- Nextel gained 8/16 to 20-3/16.</p>
</text>
